                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e6cdbec3-585f-455b-a93a-7ba786329e16",
                                "sense_id": "3bb0a4d0-c1dd-3417-82e5-d5e8a3ee8e9c",
                                "text": "У пе́рвого госпо́дского амба́ра доро́га раздва́ивалась: одна́ ветвь шла пря́мо и исчеза́ла в вече́рней мгле, друга́я — вела́ впра́во к госпо́дскому до́му.",
                                "translation": "At the first of the granaries the road divided in two: one branch went straight on and vanished in the evening darkness, the other led to the owner's house on the right.",
                                "english": "At the first of the granaries the road divided in two: one branch went straight on and vanished in the evening darkness, the other led to the owner's house on the right."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
